#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
momo - agent-native CLI for momo購物網 (www.momoshop.com.tw, TWD). No checkout.

Zero dependencies (Python 3.8+ stdlib). Every command supports --json and
returns the {ok, data|error} envelope used by the other ~/Projects CLIs.
Exit codes: 0 ok, 1 api, 2 usage, 3 auth, 4 net/blocked.

Endpoints, measured 2026-10-29 with real requests:
--------------------------------------------------
Search (HTML + Next.js App Router RSC, plain HTTPS, no login needed):
  GET https://www.momoshop.com.tw/search/<keyword>?_isFuzzy=0&searchType=<sort>&curPage=<page>&priceS=<min>&priceE=<max>
      searchType: 1 綜合推薦 (relevance, default), 2 價格由低至高 (price),
                  3 價格由高至低 (price-desc), 6 月銷量 (sales), 5 新上市 (newest)
      Embedded application/ld+json contains ItemList with 30 items per page:
      name, offers.price, offers.availability (InStock), aggregateRating.ratingValue,
      aggregateRating.reviewCount, description (promos), url with i_code.
      RSC flight stream contains goodsCode, marketPriceModel.basePrice.price (original price).
Product detail (HTML, plain HTTPS, no login needed):
  GET https://www.momoshop.com.tw/goods/GoodsDetail.jsp?i_code=<id>
      Embedded application/ld+json contains ProductGroup with:
      name, brand.name, sku, description, hasVariant[] (sku/dtCode, name, offers.price,
      shippingDetails, in_stock), additionalProperty[] (specs/attributes).
Cart (JSON API on cart.momoshop.com.tw, requires session cookies + Authorization token):
  POST https://cart.momoshop.com.tw/api/shoppingcart/query/getEachCartPICount
       Payload: {"host": "WEB"}
       Header: Authorization: Bearer <STORAGEINFO>, VERSION: <VERSION>
       Returns resultCode: 1, custNo, and per-cart counts. Returns 403 when not logged in.
  POST https://cart.momoshop.com.tw/api/shoppingcart/query/cartPageData
       Payload: {"data":{"cartName":"newNormal","productStatus":[],"cartFlag":"2","moProGoodsCode":""},"host":"WEB"}
       Returns resultCode: 1, rtnData.shopCart.tmGoods (all active items with goodsCode,
       goodsName, goodsCount, goodsPrice, goodsdtCode, productKey, productKeys, productIds).
       When cart is empty returns resultCode "CPV006" with totalCarts: 0.
  POST https://cart.momoshop.com.tw/api/shoppingcart/modify/addGoods
       Payload: {"host":"WEB","data":{"goShopCartYn":"1","goods":[{"work":"shopcart","goodsCode":...,
       "goodsName":...,"goodsPrice":...,"goodsdtCode":"001","goodsCount":"1",...}]}}
  POST https://cart.momoshop.com.tw/api/shoppingcart/modify/changeGoodsCount
       Payload: {"host":"WEB","data":{"cartName":"newNormal","productId":...,"productIdList":[...],
       "productKey":...,"productKeyList":[...],"goodsCode":...,"goodsCount":N}}
  POST https://cart.momoshop.com.tw/api/shoppingcart/modify/removeGoods
       Payload: {"host":"WEB","data":{"cartName":"newNormal","productKey":...,"productStatus":"0",
       "productKeyList":[...]}}

Login: never passwords/OTP. `momo login` (default --from-browser) reads the
cookies of Edge on MOMO_CDP (default http://127.0.0.1:9222). If not signed in
it opens momo's login page in a background tab and polls until you sign in there.
It extracts STORAGEINFO and VERSION from the cart page and verifies the session
with getEachCartPICount before saving to ~/.config/momo/state.json (0600) or
keyring (--keyring). MOMO_COOKIE overrides both. Cart commands use the saved session.

Transport: plain HTTPS first; on bot-block or captcha falls back to CDP background tab.
--via auto|http|browser.

No checkout / payment / order placement, by design.
Unofficial. Undocumented, private API - it can break without warning.
"""
